  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fighting the Reversing Tide (the Commonwealth Equality Network)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding and consolidating hard-won progress in recent times in the fight towards LGBTI+ equality across the Commonwealth, by continuing to strengthen and support Commonwealth LGBTI+ civil society and networks&#x2019; capacities to sustainably advance LGBTI+ equality at all levels and by generating increased visibility of LGBTI+ rights and issues within stakeholder spaces in the UK, the Commonwealth and globally.</narrative>
  </description>
